flowchart LR
  A[Agent]
  T[TMS API]
  C[Change Detector]
  L[LLM Decision]
  P[Playwright / Executor]
  Q[Offline Queue]

  A -->|fetch tests| T
  A -->|analyze changes| C
  C -->|types| A
  A -->|decide| L
  L -->|strategy| A
  A -->|run| P
  P -->|result| A
  A -->|publish| T
  A -->|enqueue on failure| Q
  Q -->|retry/flush| T

  %% Labels: Execution flow -> run, Publishing flow -> publish

